#ASSERT `s 7(3A) the person can exclude or restrict liability for breach of the obligations arising under section 2 of the Supply of Goods Act 1982` (JUST TRUE) `Supply of Goods Act 1982 section 2 (implied terms about title)` `A notice that has contractual effect` `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS NOTHING
