#ASSERT `s 7(4) a requirement of reasonableness applies to the contract term` (JUST TRUE) `The assurance of quiet possession to a person taking the goods` FALSE `A contract term` `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "in a case to which subsection (3A) does not apply".
#ASSERT `s 7(4) a requirement of reasonableness applies to the contract term` (JUST TRUE) `The right to transfer ownership of the goods, or give possession` TRUE `A contract term` `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 7(4) a requirement of reasonableness applies to the contract term` (JUST TRUE) `Correspondence of the goods with description or sample` FALSE `A contract term` `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 7(4) a requirement of reasonableness applies to the contract term` (JUST FALSE) `The right to transfer ownership of the goods, or give possession` FALSE `A contract term` `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS NOTHING
