#ASSERT `s 7(4) a requirement of reasonableness applies to the contract term` (JUST TRUE) `The right to transfer ownership of the goods, or give possession` FALSE `A contract term` `Whether an exception takes the section out of the case cannot be told` EQUALS NOTHING
-- "cannot ... be excluded or restricted ... except in so far as the term satisfies the requirement of reasonableness": it does not.
#ASSERT `s 7(4) the person can exclude or restrict liability for the right to transfer ownership or the assurance of quiet possession` (JUST TRUE) `The right to transfer ownership of the goods, or give possession` FALSE `A contract term` (JUST FALSE) `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS JUST FALSE
