#ASSERT `s 7(3) the person can exclude or restrict, as against a person dealing otherwise than as consumer, the liability in subsection (2)` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) `Correspondence of the goods with description or sample` `A contract term` (JUST TRUE) `An exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS NOTHING
