§ `Item 2 of the fix round: s 5(1) in its own words`

-- "liability for the loss or damage cannot be excluded or restricted by reference to any contract term or notice contained in or operating by reference to a guarantee of the goods".
-- Arguments: goods of the private type; in consumer use; arises from the goods proving defective; results from negligence of a person concerned in making or distributing; the term is in or by reference to a guarantee; section 5 applies as between the parties; reach.
#ASSERT `s 5(1) liability for the loss or damage cannot be excluded or restricted by a term or notice in a guarantee` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) NOTHING `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The "where" (a) and (b) is not met (ruling of 2026-11-05 (b)).
#ASSERT `s 5(1) liability for the loss or damage cannot be excluded or restricted by a term or notice in a guarantee` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) NOTHING `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 5(1) liability for the loss or damage cannot be excluded or restricted by a term or notice in a guarantee` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) TRUE FALSE (JUST TRUE) NOTHING `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 5(1) liability for the loss or damage cannot be excluded or restricted by a term or notice in a guarantee` (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) NOTHING `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Consumer use is not given: not covered.
#ASSERT `s 5(1) liability for the loss or damage cannot be excluded or restricted by a term or notice in a guarantee` (JUST TRUE) NOTHING TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) NOTHING `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS NOTHING
-- A scope limit with no "only" (ruling of 2026-11-05 (c)): the goods are not of the private type, or not shown to be.
#ASSERT `s 5(1) liability for the loss or damage cannot be excluded or restricted by a term or notice in a guarantee` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) NOTHING `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 5(1) liability for the loss or damage cannot be excluded or restricted by a term or notice in a guarantee` NOTHING (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) NOTHING `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 5(1) liability for the loss or damage cannot be excluded or restricted by a term or notice in a guarantee` (JUST FALSE) (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) NOTHING `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS NOTHING
-- The term or notice is not in or by reference to a guarantee: a described subject, not a "where".
#ASSERT `s 5(1) liability for the loss or damage cannot be excluded or restricted by a term or notice in a guarantee` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE (JUST FALSE) NOTHING `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS NOTHING
-- Subsection (3): "This section does not apply as between the parties to a contract under or in pursuance of which possession or ownership of the goods passed".
#ASSERT `s 5(1) liability for the loss or damage cannot be excluded or restricted by a term or notice in a guarantee` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) (JUST FALSE) `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 5(1) liability for the loss or damage cannot be excluded or restricted by a term or notice in a guarantee` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) NOTHING `An exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 5(1) liability for the loss or damage cannot be excluded or restricted by a term or notice in a guarantee` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE (JUST TRUE) NOTHING `Whether an exception takes the section out of the case cannot be told` EQUALS NOTHING
-- The positive question stays NOTHING outside the "where": the section does not say that the person can exclude.
#ASSERT `s 5(1) the person can exclude or restrict liability for the loss or damage by a term or notice in a guarantee` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) FALSE TRUE (JUST TRUE) NOTHING `No exception takes the section out of the case` EQUALS NOTHING
